    "Use /background to start API runs. /stop stops the newest tracked run or cancels an entered run_id / X-Hermes-Request-Id; /agents refreshes runtime state; /steer, /queue, /goal and /subgoal preserve the Hermes gateway command vocabulary for queued control input." : {
